{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06FR", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-immersion-locally-finite-type}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:456b126e68e866ab36d06d369df03b175966497bd8eeff6a812f5f1bfc828fa3", "source_text": "An immersion is locally of finite type.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f76ed2ac68b4b6bf58906b1272ce8dbcebfcac4153d67ac089e49a5a6c9a3600", "unit_id": "tag:06FV:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06FR", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{remark-implication}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-immersion-locally-finite-type}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:330cec23f305ef65562a332aa889427e06e1500812df7a32ed2c93eb9836ef54", "source_text": "Combine Remark <REF_0001> with\nMorphisms of Spaces,\nLemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6a2b6839a6535ca86c2432ffa5865db53f4b6b8b88602573d17e63398196537d", "unit_id": "tag:06FV:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06FR", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{X}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-locally-finite-type-locally-noetherian}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:1b7728b54ce059d1c698c38a8e5405223fe7b2130d7cc5f1994f45bc26cf2830", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0732e4f12c7117eb0a633ec642f1273f49ced32baa01b652470a504b745f3fa7", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nIf <MATH_0002> is locally of finite type and <MATH_0003> is locally Noetherian,\nthen <MATH_0004> is locally Noetherian.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:23b80de46e78f0fed6a3cd38965b29adbdd30641562e8e9b954dec62760fd692", "unit_id": "tag:06R6:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06FR", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nU \\ar[d] \\ar[r] & V \\ar[d] \\\\\n\\mathcal{X} \\ar[r] & \\mathcal{Y}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$U$", "MATH_0003": "$V$", "MATH_0004": "$V \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$U \\to V \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0006": "$U \\to V$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0008": "$V$", "MATH_0009": "$U$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-finite-type-noetherian}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e2ec712fad420fb6896648d85eda828d51a7a97dfef9ccaf5491100d711ee5f9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1782288a380faa1edd15c0d724f63593c96378d1ead9a794385bcc5c330b31d1", "source_text": "Let\n<MATH_0001>\nbe a commutative diagram where <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003> are schemes,\n<MATH_0004> is surjective and smooth, and\n<MATH_0005> is surjective and smooth.\nThen <MATH_0006> is locally of finite type. If <MATH_0007> is\nlocally Noetherian, then <MATH_0008> is locally Noetherian. By\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0001>\nwe see that <MATH_0009> is locally Noetherian, which means that <MATH_0010>\nis locally Noetherian.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ef37b99a2db6ad65e80faffb228f61bc4c819f986152d91b3ad67522d759fef6", "unit_id": "tag:06R6:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06FR", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a4510f1a3ac8aea6950615909f448356a91d14a55d9d9a4614b01ea9881e5e44", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe following two lemmas will be improved on later (after we have discussed\nmorphisms of algebraic stacks which are locally of finite presentation).\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d5565a80e2856e66d3c5945aa2218f866d1bdb58e9dbc7705ee362e8ec4b8524", "unit_id": "tag:06FR:prose-0002"}
